{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:0.1"], "en": "Theragāthā 2.34 Dukanipāta,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:0.2", "PA_thag_2.34:0.3"], "en": "Catutthavagga (The Fourth Chapter)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:0.4"], "en": "The Verses of the Elder Isidatta:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:1.1"], "en": "“I have seen lay followers who uphold the Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:1.2"], "en": "proclaiming that sensual pleasures are impermanent.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:1.3"], "en": "Intoxicated with passion for jeweled earrings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:1.4"], "en": "and having expectations for children and wives,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:2.1"], "en": "they certainly do not know the Dhamma here.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:2.2"], "en": "They say that sensual pleasures are impermanent,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:2.3"], "en": "yet they have no strength to cut off passion for them;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:2.4"], "en": "therefore, they remain attached to children, wives, and wealth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_2.34:2.5"], "en": "… the elder Isidinna …", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"}
]
